393
00:21:43,229 --> 00:21:45,049
There's gotta be something you can do!

394
00:21:45,449 --> 00:21:47,869
If he sees mermaids, it will be death!

395
00:21:47,969 --> 00:21:48,929
How cruel!

396
00:21:48,929 --> 00:21:52,929
I don't care...

397
00:21:52,929 --> 00:21:53,509
Sanji!

398
00:21:53,889 --> 00:21:58,309
I don't want to live in a world without dreams.

399
00:21:58,789 --> 00:22:01,589
I'd rather die leering in some hot mermaid tail.

400
00:22:02,149 --> 00:22:03,549
