407
00:22:17,549 --> 00:22:18,189
Hey!

408
00:22:18,849 --> 00:22:21,289
Wipe up that drool and tell Soda Mae to go!

409
00:22:21,509 --> 00:22:23,269
There's an entrance around here somewhere,

410
00:22:23,429 --> 00:22:24,289
and we've gotta find it!

411
00:22:24,309 --> 00:22:24,749
Guys!

412
00:22:24,889 --> 00:22:25,749
We got company!

413
00:22:31,549 --> 00:22:33,369
Oh, crap.

414
00:22:33,569 --> 00:22:34,389
That's not good.

415
00:22:39,549 --> 00:22:40,509
Sea monsters!

416
00:22:40,969 --> 00:22:42,049
Giant ones!

417
00:22:42,049 --> 00:22:46,049
And now we're dead!

418
00:22:54,049 --> 00:22:54,389
Wow, they look tough!

419
00:22:54,509 --> 00:22:56,469
I want one!

420
00:23:03,009 --> 00:23:05,269
Wait, is somebody riding them?

421
00:23:05,269 --> 00:23:06,429
Yeah!

422
00:23:07,069 --> 00:23:07,669
Yeah!

423
00:23:08,229 --> 00:23:10,529
Although Fishman Island is at sight,

424
00:23:10,809 --> 00:23:13,089
Luffy's descent is halted by a crew of fishmen

425
00:23:13,089 --> 00:23:15,109
riding atop massive sea monsters.

426
00:23:15,569 --> 00:23:17,489
Calling themselves the new Fishman Pirates,

427
00:23:17,729 --> 00:23:20,389
they speak of Luffy's old adversary, Arlong.

428
00:23:20,949 --> 00:23:21,869
Running out of time,

429
00:23:21,989 --> 00:23:23,709
the Straw Hats attempt a desperate maneuver

430
00:23:23,709 --> 00:23:26,129
to propel themselves straight into their destination

431
00:23:26,129 --> 00:23:27,429
at any cost.

432
00:23:27,689 --> 00:23:29,149
On the next One Piece,

433
00:23:29,489 --> 00:23:31,189
landing at the Fishman Island,

434
00:23:31,389 --> 00:23:32,669
